**Fix applied** — `src/url_utils.ts`

The bug was a `break` on line 14 inside the tracking-param loop. It exited after stripping the *first* matching param, so any additional tracking param (e.g. `fbclid` when `utm_source` was already removed) stayed in the saved URL. Removing the `break` lets the loop strip every param in `TRACKING_PARAMS` that is present.

